">21q22.2</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">SCLC &#x0002b;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label/><p>SCLC=small cell lung cancer; NSCLC=non-small cell lung cancer; &#x0002b;=increased expression in the indicated cell type; &#x02212;=decreased expression in the indicated cell type.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>